      "Parameters": {
        "Text": "Based on your name and the phone number on your account, here are three personalized vanity number ideas. Option one: $.External.vanityOption1Speak. Option two: $.External.vanityOption2Speak. Option three: $.External.vanityOption3Speak. Thank you for calling Acme Financial Services. Goodbye."
